# 行尾策略：仓库内统一存 LF，检出时按需转换。
# 背景：全局 core.autocrlf=true 会把 .sh 转成 CRLF，导致 bash 脚本报
#       `bash: ./xxx.sh: /bin/bash^M: bad interpreter`，故 .sh 强制 LF。

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.wxml text eol=lf
*.wxss text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# 二进制资源，不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
